    "regime_notes": "Positive in 2025-2027 (IC 0.01306, ICIR 0.04353) and 2028-2030-04-15 (IC 0.03302, ICIR 0.10573); early warmup regime unavailable for this artifact due to source coverage. Small cross-section requires conservative interpretation.",
